      "label": "第 82 頁",
      "title": "On-Site Training（續頁）",
      "section": "A6 · Training Requirements / Course Outlines",
      "text": "authorities and contractors having operation, repair or maintenance contracts.\n\nOn-Site Training\n\nOn-site training is to consist of putting into practice, under the supervision of an experienced Senior Authorised Person, the knowledge gained during the familiarisation period. During this period, the prospective Senior Authorised/Authorised Person is to keep a record of each event attended in a personal Log Book detailing the actions taken both personally and by the Senior Authorised Person. This Log Book produced at the interview with the Authorising Engineer or a qualified nominated representative.",
      "html": "<p>authorities and contractors having operation, repair or maintenance contracts.</p>\n<h3>On-Site Training</h3>\n<p>On-site training is to consist of putting into practice, under the supervision of an experienced Senior Authorised Person, the knowledge gained during the familiarisation period. During this period, the prospective Senior Authorised/Authorised Person is to keep a record of each event attended in a personal Log Book detailing the actions taken both personally and by the Senior Authorised Person. This Log Book produced at the interview with the Authorising Engineer or a qualified nominated representative.</p>",
